  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CEPI - Covid-19 contributions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CEPI is a partnership of public, private and humanitarian organizations. The Coalition will fund/stimulate development of vaccines against Covid19, and will work with partners to ensure equitable access to these vaccines. (ODA share of contribution. See QZA-17/0057-2 for TOSSD share).</narrative>
  </description>
